// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// BigTaka Content Network — Scheduled Jobs Configuration
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Wix Scheduled Jobs run backend functions on a schedule.
// Configure these in the Wix Editor: Dev Mode > Scheduled Jobs
//
// Job 1: Update Trending Articles
//   Function: backend/analytics.jsw → updateTrendingFlags
//   Schedule: Every 3 hours
//   Description: Recalculates trending articles based on recent view data
//
// Job 2: Generate Sitemap
//   Function: backend/seo.jsw → generateSitemapData
//   Schedule: Daily at 2:00 AM
//   Description: Refreshes the sitemap data with latest articles
//
// To set up:
// 1. In Wix Editor, enable Dev Mode
// 2. Go to Backend > jobs.config
// 3. Add the scheduled jobs with the functions and schedules above
//
// Example jobs.config format for Wix:
// {
//   "jobs": [
//     {
//       "functionLocation": "/analytics.jsw",
//       "functionName": "updateTrendingFlags",
//       "description": "Update trending article flags every 3 hours",
//       "executionConfig": {
//         "cronExpression": "0 */3 * * *"
//       }
//     }
//   ]
// }
